--- !u!114 &2597713784979025642
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 3369559889407715249}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 4b699ca735e2a9e4fa2766081f49bc81, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  npcId: 0
  nameNpc: Dung
  npcDialogues:
  - dialogues:
    - name: Jake
      dialogueContent: "Ugh... my head. Everything is spinning. \nWhere am I ?"
    - name: Dung
      dialogueContent: "Hey, hey! You\u2019re finally up! I\u2019m Dung.\nWelcome
        to our little paradise."
    - name: Jake
      dialogueContent: "Paradise? I can\u2019t remember a thing. \nIt feels like
        a nightmare. Why can't \nI remember my past?"
    - name: Dung
      dialogueContent: "Honestly? It\u2019s better this way. No bad \nmemories, no
        regrets. You\u2019re part of \nthe family now, Jake. That\u2019s all."
    - name: Jake
      dialogueContent: "Family... I guess I have nowhere to go. \nIs there anything
        I can do to help ?"
    - name: Dung
      dialogueContent: "I knew I liked you! Always eager to serve. \nWe need to expand
        the camp, make it stronger."
    - name: Dung
      dialogueContent: "Go chop some Wood for me. Consider it \nyour initiation.
        Don't let me down, brother."
    - name: Dung
      dialogueContent: I knew I chose the right one
    questDefinition: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 72d51abea6d5e2545ba914aa06472934, type: 2}
    onQuestCompleteDialogue: Easy man
    onQuestNotCompleteDialogue: I havent done yet
    indexQuestDialogue: 6
    acceptQuestLine: Let that for me
    refuseQuestLine: Nah may be later
  - dialogues:
    - name: Dung
      dialogueContent: "Good work on the wood. But look around \nyou, Jake. A few
        logs aren't enough to \nkeep the nightmare out."
    - name: Jake
      dialogueContent: "It seems... organized here. Everyone \nis running around
        doing something."
    - name: Dung
      dialogueContent: "We have to be. Chaos is death in this forest. \nOver time,
        we\u2019ve built a system. "
    - name: Dung
      dialogueContent: "We have Scavengers risking their necks \nfor food. Scouts
        mapping the unknown. \nMedics stitching up the ones who aren't \nfast enough.
        And Builders... like us."
    - name: Jake
      dialogueContent: "That\u2019s a lot of roles. Where do I fit in?"
    - name: Dung
      dialogueContent: "You have strength, and you have obedience. \nThat is rare.
        Right now, the Scavengers bring food, \nbut the walls are weak."
    - name: Dung
      dialogueContent: "Wood burns, Jake. We need something \npermanent. Something
        that lasts forever."
    - name: Dung
      dialogueContent: "I need Stone. Lots of it. We are going to \nturn this camp
        into a fortress."
    - name: Dung
      dialogueContent: "Solid work. Wood rots, but stone... \nstone is forever."
    questDefinition: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 23e935dfd90995a41a4dd22850520f3a, type: 2}
    onQuestCompleteDialogue: I have completed
    onQuestNotCompleteDialogue: I havent done yet
    indexQuestDialogue: 7
    acceptQuestLine: Copy it
    refuseQuestLine: That out of my league
  endTalk: I dont have anything to say with  you
  npcAvatar: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 7aef6fccbf5c4a54aac2dcb661334f31, type: 3}
  onQuest: 0
  onQuestDialogue: Have you done yet ?
  interactRadius: 3
  interacting: 0
  interactingKey: {fileID: 3703617466603374644}
  isQuestGiver: 0
